    "Description": "Slice 2a-2 real-interpreter proof demo: on tick, GetShared\u003CSquadRallyState\u003E(\u0022rally\u0022) reads the entity-scoped shared slot, a pure FunctionCall increments RallyCount, SetShared\u003CSquadRallyState\u003E(\u0022rally\u0022, ...) writes it back, then Return(Success). Proves GetShared/SetShared compile to calls into Fdp.Toolkit.Blueprints.Partitioning.BlueprintSharedState (Slice 2a-1) and that repeated ticks accumulate RallyCount through the accessor \u002B StructureHash guard.",
